  "name": "Elemental Cluster",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">These crystals grow naturally in Ardor’s caverns and within the soil, or in places strongly aligned with magical flows such as leylines or founts. They typically are aspected towards a single element, and grow in clusters. They can be found aspected to Fire, Cold, Electricity, Earth, Water, Air, Acid, Vitality, Void or Force. These crystals are normally used to power arcanotechnology due to their capability of being used as either elemental fuel or to act as a conduit for elemental-aspected magic within a machine’s mechanisms.</p>"
